📄 Smart Waste Management System – Project Document
1. Project Description

The Smart Waste Management System is an IoT-based solution designed to monitor garbage levels in bins using sensors. It automates waste collection by notifying authorities when bins are full, reducing manual inspection, fuel consumption, and improving urban cleanliness.

2. Objectives
Monitor waste levels in real-time
Send alerts when garbage bins are full
Optimize waste collection routes
Reduce environmental pollution
3. Technologies Used

Hardware:

Arduino Nano / Uno
Ultrasonic Sensor
GSM Module

Software:

Arduino IDE

Concepts:

Internet of Things (IoT)
Embedded Systems
